36
00:05:10,815 --> 00:05:23,055
[Slow] また、住所や電話番号など、品物を届けるための情報も、およそ78万件ありました。

37
00:05:23,855 --> 00:05:30,983
[Host] There were also about seven hundred eighty thousand records for delivering goods, like addresses and phone numbers.

38
