[Vocab] 届ける

39
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:36,831
[Host] It means to deliver something to someone.

40
00:05:37,432 --> 00:05:46,744
[Slow] 今の会員だけでなく、やめてから3年以内の人の情報も含まれています。

41
00:05:47,543 --> 00:05:53,567
[Host] Not only current members are affected, but also people who quit within the last three years.

42
00:05:54,168 --> 00:05:56,663
[Vocab] 含まれる

43
00:05:57,064 --> 00:05:58,935
[Host] It means to be included.

44
00:05:59,536 --> 00:06:06,303
[Slow] クレジットカードの情報は、漏れていないということです。

45
00:06:07,103 --> 00:06:09,935
[Host] Credit card information did not leak.

46
00:06:10,536 --> 00:06:21,048
[Slow] 通信販売のサイトは今も止まっていて、いつ再開するかは、まだ決まっていません。

47
00:06:21,848 --> 00:06:26,887
[Host] The online shop is still closed, and there is no date yet for when it will open again.

48
00:06:27,487 --> 00:06:30,295
[Vocab] 再開する

49
00:06:30,696 --> 00:06:33,264
[Host] It means to start again after a stop.

50
00:06:33,863 --> 00:06:43,992
[Slow] すでに注文された商品は、23日から順番に送り始めるということです。

51
00:06:44,791 --> 00:06:50,552
[Host] Items people already ordered will start shipping, one after another, from the twenty-third.

52
00:06:51,151 --> 00:07:01,327
[Slow] 会社は、タワーレコードのふりをした怪しいメールに、気をつけるよう呼びかけています。

53
00:07:02,127 --> 00:07:08,391
[Host] The company is warning people to watch out for suspicious emails that pretend to be from Tower Records.

54
00:07:08,992 --> 00:07:11,415
